{"about_the_game":"Fumpers?<br />\r\nYour goal is to complete the track by jumping.<br />\r\nLet's See How Quick You Can Be at Doing This.<br />\r\nThe game tries to annoy you with annoying traps and the sound of the devil's laughter every time you die.<br />\r\nNo registration system, try not to die.<br />\r\nEach time you die, you will enter more experienced next time.<br />\r\nThe Slavic God Svarog Statue is watching you from the corner of the game.<br />\r\nTry to reach your house safely by jumping from the platforms.<br />\r\nThere is no rule that the shortcut will always be hard.<br />\r\nSvarog has moved some platforms for you and put some high bouncing nuts in some places, don't forget to evaluate.<br />\r\nDo not get angry and try to finish the game without closing it.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2280670?t=1736337502","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2280670?t=1736337502","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736337502","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2280670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736337502","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Fumpers?<br />\r\nYour goal is to complete the track by jumping.<br />\r\nLet's See How Quick You Can Be at Doing This.<br />\r\nThe game tries to annoy you with annoying traps and the sound of the devil's laughter every time you die.<br />\r\nNo registration system, try not to die.<br />\r\nEach time you die, you will enter more experienced next time.<br />\r\nThe Slavic God Svarog Statue is watching you from the corner of the game.